# Walkthrough - Final ISO 14064-1 Compliance

I have successfully implemented the remaining features required for full ISO 14064-1 compliance. The application now supports formal base year recalculation logging and generates comprehensive verification reports for third-party auditors.

## Key Changes

### 1. Base Year Recalculation Log (ISO §5.2)
The system now tracks not just the base year, but every change made to it, including the reason and the user who made the change.

